var.txt:
For sample adults and sample children, GOTWAGE indicates whether they or any family members 18 or older received income from wages, salaries, commissions, bonuses, tips, or self-employment during the previous calendar year. Prior to 2019, GOTWAGE was asked only of sample adults.

Related Variables

Additional sources of income include:

Self-employment (GOTSEMP);

Social Security or Railroad Retirement (GOTSS);

Any other pension (GOTOTHPEN);

Dividends or net rental income (GOTDIV);

Interest income (GOTINT);

Child support (GOTCHSUP).

Income from any other source (GOTOTHER).

Retirement, survivor, or disability pensions (GOTRET).
